37.290" end="00:38.700">easily</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.270" end="00:40.860"><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.630">Don't </span><span begin="00:39.630" end="00:40.080">wanna </span><span begin="00:40.080" end="00:40.860">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.860" end="00:43.350"><span begin="00:40.860" end="00:40.950">what </span><span begin="00:40.950" end="00:41.220">kind </span><span begin="00:41.220" end="00:41.280">of </span><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:41.670">dress </span><span begin="00:41.670" end="00:41.850">you're </span><span begin="00:41.850" end="00:42.330">wearing </span><span begin="00:42.330" end="00:43.350">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.410" end="00:45.690"><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:43.590">If </span><span begin="00:43.590" end="00:43.770">he's </span><span begin="00:43.770" end="00:44.160">holding </span><span begin="00:44.160" end="00:44.610">onto </span><span begin="00:44.610" end="00:44.700">you </span><span begin="00:44.700" end="00:44.940">so </span><span begin="00:44.940" end="00:45.690">tight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.690" end="00:48.240"><span begin="00:45.690" end="00:46.080">The </span><span begin="00:46.080" end="00:46.500">way </span><span begin="00:46.500" end="00:46.710">I </span><span begin="00:46.710" end="00:46.980">did </span><span begin="00:46.980" end="00:48.240">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.870" end="00:50.550"><span begin="00:48.870" end="00:49.320">I </span><span begin="00:49.320" end="00:50.550">overdosed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.550" end="00:52.920"><span begin="00:50.550" end="00:50.910">Should've </span><span begin="00:50.910" end="00:51.210">known </span><span begin="00:51.210" end="00:51.480">your </span><span begin="00:51.480" end="00:51.840">love </span><span begin="00:51.840" end="00:52.020">was </span><span begin="00:52.020" end="00:52.140">a </span><span begin="00:52.140" end="00:52.920">game</span></p><p ttm:ag